  "title": "Daily Briefing: A personalized summary of your news, delivered on your schedule",
  "summary": "<p>Every morning I open NewsBlur and scroll through hundreds of unread stories. Most days I can keep up. But some days I just want someone to tell me what matters. What’s the big story across my feeds? What are the long reads I should save for later? What matches the topics I’ve trained as interesting?</p> That’s the Daily Briefing. It reads your feeds, scores every story, and writes a personalized summary organized into sections that make sense for the way you read. It shows up as a feed in ...",
